WEBVTT

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:12.994
You look ravishing.

00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:15.371
Thank you. I just...

00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:26.966
So...

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.803
Does Captain Ericka have a last name?

00:00:32.471 --> 00:00:34.181
Guacamole!

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:35.975
"Ericka Guacamole"?

00:00:36.058 --> 00:00:39.395
That's so international.

00:00:39.478 --> 00:00:42.606
No. Guacamole for us to share.

00:00:43.941 --> 00:00:45.609
How beautiful is that full moon tonight?

00:00:45.693 --> 00:00:46.986
Look. Right behind you.

00:00:52.241 --> 00:00:54.744
The food here is to die for.

00:01:05.629 --> 00:01:08.966
Holy moly, that was a lot of guacamole.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.677
Are you feeling all right?

00:01:11.761 --> 00:01:14.347
-Totally fine. Why?
-No reason.

00:01:17.683 --> 00:01:21.479
There must have been garlic
in the guacamole.

00:01:21.562 --> 00:01:22.563
No.

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.398
Isn't that deadly for you?

00:01:24.482 --> 00:01:26.525
No, no, no. It's just that I'm...

00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:29.028
Garlic intolerant.

00:01:37.411 --> 00:01:38.621
Was that you?

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.168
Yeah!

00:01:44.418 --> 00:01:46.587
Dolphin surfing!

00:01:55.638 --> 00:01:57.139
Hi, Mama. Hi, Papa.

00:01:57.223 --> 00:01:58.224
Hey-hey.

00:01:58.391 --> 00:01:59.392
Hey there.

00:02:00.059 --> 00:02:01.977
-Papa.
-Hidey-ho!

00:02:02.061 --> 00:02:03.104
Hi.

00:02:03.854 --> 00:02:05.564
Is my dad in there, too?

00:02:07.149 --> 00:02:08.984
Don't worry, I'm over here.

00:02:11.028 --> 00:02:14.240
No, Papa Drac's not here.
He's on his date.

00:02:15.032 --> 00:02:16.158
Date?

00:02:19.036 --> 00:02:21.122
Please, forgive me,

00:02:21.622 --> 00:02:23.165
I'm just very nervous.

00:02:23.249 --> 00:02:24.333
You see,

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:30.506
I haven't had a date since my wife died.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.135
How old was your daughter?

00:02:34.343 --> 00:02:36.345
She was just an infant.

00:02:36.429 --> 00:02:40.808
It was hard being a single dad,
but I did my best.

00:02:43.644 --> 00:02:45.855
I never knew my mother, either.

00:02:46.355 --> 00:02:47.731
Or my father.

00:02:47.815 --> 00:02:49.733
I'm so sorry.

00:02:49.817 --> 00:02:51.026
Who raised you?

00:02:51.527 --> 00:02:52.820
My great-grandfather.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.489
I basically grew up on this ship.

00:02:55.823 --> 00:02:58.159
That's why you're a captain.

00:02:58.242 --> 00:03:00.786
Yeah. It's all I've ever known.

00:03:01.579 --> 00:03:04.039
It was just expected.

00:03:04.915 --> 00:03:06.459
You know, a family thing.

00:03:06.542 --> 00:03:10.129
I understand, family is everything.

00:03:10.337 --> 00:03:12.548
You have to honor the past.

00:03:13.174 --> 00:03:15.426
But we make our own future.

00:03:28.814 --> 00:03:30.608
-Dad?
-Mavis!

00:03:32.026 --> 00:03:33.152
Johnny!

00:03:35.696 --> 00:03:40.659
Captain Ericka and I were just
discussing the hospitality industry.

00:03:40.743 --> 00:03:42.620
You know, just work stuff.

00:03:42.703 --> 00:03:44.205
You're working now?

00:03:44.288 --> 00:03:46.081
This is supposed to be a vacation.

00:03:46.165 --> 00:03:47.458
A family vacation.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.128
I should really go do captain-y things.

00:03:51.212 --> 00:03:54.048
Dad, you said you were
gonna spend time with Dennis.

00:03:54.131 --> 00:03:57.426
Dennis. Dennis? Dennis.

00:03:58.135 --> 00:04:00.012
Yeah, you're right. Where is that kid?

00:04:00.095 --> 00:04:02.806
Denisovich?
You're supposed to be with me.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.892
Come on now, kid, it's family time.

00:04:04.975 --> 00:04:06.602
Quit hiding. Dennis?

00:04:07.937 --> 00:04:09.230
What was that about?

00:04:09.313 --> 00:04:10.439
You mean your dad's date?

00:04:10.523 --> 00:04:13.359
It wasn't a date. It was work stuff.

00:04:14.902 --> 00:04:16.153
I'm telling you, Johnny,

00:04:16.237 --> 00:04:18.405
there is something
about that woman I don't trust.

00:04:18.489 --> 00:04:21.534
But you want your dad
to be happy, right?

00:04:21.617 --> 00:04:22.618
Yes.

00:04:23.118 --> 00:04:24.745
Just not with her.

00:04:26.914 --> 00:04:27.915
Heads up, honey.

00:04:27.998 --> 00:04:30.334
This guac is loaded with garlic.

00:04:30.417 --> 00:04:31.502
Garlic?

00:04:38.551 --> 00:04:40.553
That was a cute toot, honey.

00:04:57.903 --> 00:05:00.489
-We've been up all night!
-Let's stay up all day, too!

00:05:00.573 --> 00:05:02.157
Let's get wild!

00:05:15.212 --> 00:05:16.964
-Ericka!
-What?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:20.551
Just where have you been, young lady?

00:05:21.385 --> 00:05:22.928
Doing work.

00:05:23.012 --> 00:05:24.847
Wearing that?

00:05:25.014 --> 00:05:27.516
You were with him! I know it!

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:28.809
Who?

00:05:29.518 --> 00:05:31.604
"Who?" You know who!

00:05:31.687 --> 00:05:34.189
You've been sneaking around my back

00:05:34.273 --> 00:05:37.610
trying to kill Dracula again,
haven't you?

00:05:37.693 --> 00:05:40.362
So what if I have? I am a grown woman!

00:05:40.446 --> 00:05:41.739
I have the right to kill whoever I want.

00:05:41.822 --> 00:05:44.074
It's not just about you.

00:05:44.158 --> 00:05:47.036
You could have ruined the legacy.

00:05:47.411 --> 00:05:49.538
What if he discovered who you were?

00:05:50.247 --> 00:05:53.542
I know. I wasn't thinking.
There's just something about him

00:05:53.626 --> 00:05:55.461
that just drives me crazy!

00:05:55.544 --> 00:05:58.422
-I just, I see him, and I want to...
-Punch him?

00:05:59.798 --> 00:06:01.175
I guess.

00:06:01.383 --> 00:06:03.510
Just, I can't wait
to get this over with.

00:06:03.594 --> 00:06:05.804
Don't worry, it won't be long now.

00:06:05.888 --> 00:06:08.974
Once you recover
the instrument of destruction,

00:06:09.058 --> 00:06:11.101
no one can stop us.

00:06:11.185 --> 00:06:12.936
Not even Dracula!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.482
-Excuse me.
-Spies!

00:06:21.153 --> 00:06:23.489
Now, quickly, before someone comes!

